    "Volume, brightness, Wi-Fi networks, Bluetooth devices, audio output and input sources work directly in Duo. Opening the Wi-Fi network list requests Location access when needed. Dark Mode, Night Shift and True Tone can also be switched directly when supported." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音量、亮度、Wi-Fi 网络、蓝牙设备、声音输出和输入法均可直接在 Duo 面板内操作。打开 Wi-Fi 网络列表时，如需定位权限会请求授权。系统支持时，深色、夜览和原彩也可直接切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume, brightness, Wi-Fi power, Bluetooth devices, audio output and input sources work directly in Duo. The Wi-Fi network button opens the system Wi-Fi popover directly. Show the system Wi-Fi icon in the menu bar and allow Accessibility access to use this shortcut. Dark Mode, Night Shift and True Tone can also be switched directly when supported." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音量、亮度、Wi-Fi 开关、蓝牙设备、声音输出和输入法均可直接在面板内操作。Wi-Fi 网络入口直接打开系统 Wi-Fi 浮窗。使用此快捷入口需要在菜单栏显示系统 Wi-Fi 图标，并授予辅助功能权限。系统支持时，深色、夜览和原彩也可直接切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
